---
import Footer from '~/components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '~/components/Header.astro';
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '~/utils/config';

const tagClasses =
	'inline-block font-ui text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider py-[0.4rem] px-[0.9rem] border-2 border-line bg-accent text-inverted';

const tagOutlineClasses =
	'inline-block font-ui text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider py-[0.4rem] px-[0.9rem] border-2 border-line bg-transparent text-base';

const listBoxClasses =
	'my-8 border-[3px] border-line bg-card p-6 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-text-base))] transition-all duration-150 hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-accent-rgb))]';

const sidebarBoxClasses =
	'border-[3px] border-line bg-card p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-text-base))] transition-all duration-150 hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5';

const sidebarBoxAccentClasses =
	'border-[3px] border-line bg-fill p-5 shadow-[4px_4px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-accent-rgb))] transition-all duration-150 hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5';

const sidebarLinkClasses =
	'flex items-center gap-2 font-ui text-sm font-medium p-2 border-2 border-transparent text-base no-underline transition-all duration-150 hover:border-line hover:bg-fill hover:shadow-[2px_2px_0_0_rgb(var(--color-text-base))] hover:-translate-x-px hover:-translate-y-px hover:no-underline';
---

<Layout title={`About | ${site.title}`}>
	<Header activeNav="about" />
	<main id="main-content" class="flex-1">
		<!-- Header Section -->
		<section class="border-b-[3px] border-line px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
				<div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
					<span class={tagClasses}>About</span>
					<span class={tagOutlineClasses}>The author</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="font-display text-5xl tracking-wide sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
					Timon<br />Jurschitsch
				</h1>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Content Section -->
		<section class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
				<div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr]">
					<!-- Main content -->
					<div class="space-y-6 font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-base/90">
						<p
							class="first-letter:float-left first-letter:mt-1 first-letter:mr-1 first-letter:font-display first-letter:text-5xl first-letter:leading-none"
						>
							I'm very passionate about learning. I listen to a lot of
							educational podcasts, I watch documentaries and read a lot of
							articles that may or may not add something valuable. But the more
							knowledge I gain, I realize that I don't know very much about
							anything.
						</p>

						<p>
							I want to change that. That's why I started this blog. The goal of
							this is that I learn something new almost every day. It does not
							have to be a skill or very fundamental. But writing it down will
							help me in a few ways:
						</p>

						<div class={listBoxClasses}>
							<ul class="space-y-4">
								<li class="flex gap-4">
									<span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent"
										>01</span
									>
									<div>
										<strong
											class="font-ui font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase"
											>Retention</strong
										>
										<p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
											For the brain to remember stuff the same neurons and
											synapses have to fire multiple times. Repetition is the
											key, but not all knowledge we come across can be
											immediately used. Writing it down on the other hand is
											something one might easily do.
										</p>
									</div>
								</li>
								<li class="flex gap-4 border-t-[2px] border-line pt-4">
									<span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent"
										>02</span
									>
									<div>
										<strong
											class="font-ui font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase"
											>Understanding</strong
										>
										<p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
											The most important part of the
											<a
												href="https://todoist.com/inspiration/feynman-technique"
												target="_blank"
												rel="noreferrer"
												class="underline hover:text-accent">Feynman Technique</a
											>
											is to imagine explaining something to a child. Breaking your
											knowledge down into easily digestible chunks will show you gaps
											in said knowledge that you were unaware of.
										</p>
									</div>
								</li>
								<li class="flex gap-4 border-t-[2px] border-line pt-4">
									<span class="flex-shrink-0 font-display text-2xl text-accent"
										>03</span
									>
									<div>
										<strong
											class="font-ui font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase"
											>Showing Up</strong
										>
										<p class="mt-1 text-base opacity-80">
											This blog should theoretically force me to keep showing up
											in learning new things.
										</p>
									</div>
								</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<p>
							The journey from studying medicine, working as an anesthesiologist
							for a few years, to a developer is a weird one. Trying to learn
							something new every day will help me gain more knowledge in topics
							I'm not nearly as knowledgeable as I want to be.
						</p>

						<p>
							Join me on this journey of continuous learning. Everyone started
							somewhere.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Sidebar -->
					<div class="space-y-6">
						<div class={sidebarBoxClasses}>
							<h3 class="mb-4 font-display text-xl tracking-wide">Connect</h3>
							<div class="space-y-3">
								<a href="/posts" class={sidebarLinkClasses}>
									<svg
										xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
										width="18"
										height="18"
										viewBox="0 0 24 24"
										fill="none"
										stroke="currentColor"
										stroke-width="2"
										stroke-linecap="square"
										stroke-linejoin="miter"
									>
										<path
											d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"
										></path>
										<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
										<line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
										<line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
										<polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
									</svg>
									<span>All Posts</span>
								</a>
								<a href="/search" class={sidebarLinkClasses}>
									<svg
										xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
										width="18"
										height="18"
										viewBox="0 0 24 24"
										fill="none"
										stroke="currentColor"
										stroke-width="2"
										stroke-linecap="square"
										stroke-linejoin="miter"
									>
										<circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
										<line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line>
									</svg>
									<span>Search</span>
								</a>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class={sidebarBoxAccentClasses}>
							<h3 class="mb-3 font-display text-xl tracking-wide text-accent">
								Status
							</h3>
							<p class="font-body text-sm opacity-80">
								Currently learning in public. Writing about web development,
								computer science, and whatever else catches my curiosity.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
